      "evidence_role": "supportive"
    },
    {
      "card_ids": ["C05"],
      "claim": "The poor B/P ratio of 0.14 for S18886 is a weak contradictory signal because that molecule contains a carboxylic acid and a rigid tetralin, liabilities absent in the query, so it does not outweigh the supportive carbamate analogues.",
